                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Knights have a hand weapon, shield and partial plate armour. May have double handed weapon (+3) and full plate armour (+1). May be Veteran (+1), and Stubborn (+3). May be Riding Horses (+1).

Foot soldiers have a hand weapon and thrusting spear. May have shield (+1) and light armour (+2). May exchange thrusting spear for halberd (free) and may then have heavy armour (+3).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="d5cf-7461-fdf3-de4f" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">3+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="With conditional bonuses" typeId="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="d5e4-804e-6192-0114">Armour save from armour, shield and barding bonus pips (rulebook pp.95-98); maximum 3+ (2+ for barded cavalry). M already includes encumbrance for armour/barding (p.96). Conditional pips are in the next column.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
              <!-- armour-save -->
            </profile>
          </profiles>
